# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# LandLORDER Environment Variables
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Node Environment
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
NODE_ENV=development
PORT=3000

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Database Connection
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# PostgreSQL connection string
# Local format: postgresql://postgres:password@localhost:5432/landlorder
# Railway format: postgresql://user:password@host:port/database
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres:password@localhost:5432/landlorder

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Authentication (JWT)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Any random string, at least 32 characters. Used to sign/verify JWTs.
# Generate: node -e "console.log(require('crypto').randomBytes(32).toString('hex'))"
JWT_SECRET=your-super-secret-jwt-key-at-least-32-characters-long

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Stripe Billing
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Get from: https://dashboard.stripe.com/apikeys
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_your_test_secret_key_here
STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=whsec_test_your_webhook_secret_here

# Stripe price IDs (from your Stripe Dashboard > Products > Prices)
# These should be configured in Stripe as:
#   - Landlord Pro (Monthly): $9.99/mo
#   - Landlord Pro (Annual):  $99.99/yr
#   - Landlord Business (Monthly): $29.99/mo
#   - Landlord Business (Annual):  $299.99/yr
STRIPE_PRICE_PRO_MONTHLY=price_1234567890abcdef
STRIPE_PRICE_PRO_ANNUAL=price_0fedcba9876543211
STRIPE_PRICE_BUSINESS_MONTHLY=price_abcdef1234567890
STRIPE_PRICE_BUSINESS_ANNUAL=price_0987654321fedcba

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Frontend URL
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Used for:
#   - CORS allowed origins
#   - Stripe redirect URLs (success/cancel)
FRONTEND_URL=http://localhost:5173

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Google Places API (for landlord search/autocomplete)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Get from: https://console.cloud.google.com
# Enable: Google Places API
GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=your_google_places_api_key_here

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Supabase Auth (Optional)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# If using Supabase Auth instead of custom JWT:
# SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
# SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your_anon_key_here
